from pathlib import Path
import html,json
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parent;P=R.parent
load=lambda p:json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
q=load(R/'QUALIFICATION.json');old=load(P/'transition-power-v97/RESULTS.json');comp=load(R/'COMPUTATION-QUALIFICATION.json');e=lambda x:html.escape(str(x));pct=lambda x:f'{100*x:.2f}%'
def table(h,rs):return '<div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr>'+''.join('<th>'+e(v)+'</th>' for v in h)+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+''.join('<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+str(v)+'</td>' for v in row)+'</tr>' for row in rs)+'</tbody></table></div>'
body='<p class="muted">VOYNICH · TRANSITION-PRESERVING MAXT QUALIFICATION · v98</p><h1>Does conditional maxT meet the frozen power requirements?</h1><p class="notice"><strong>Qualification '+q['status']+'. No manuscript rescore performed.</strong> Sampler, null-size, numerical precision and rank checks pass in StageA, but moderate-effect power fails in every view. Strong-effect power passes only the primary bath views. Frozen rules stop before robustness banks2and3; these are NOT RUN, not hidden successes or failures.</p>'
body+='<h2>Unchanged actual constraints and full search family</h2><p>Bath hand2/B/P and Starred hand3/B/P, H/F separate on original shared loci. Every readable span keeps its literal endpoints, word multiset and all adjacent sh/qok/other transitions. Unknown barriers remain. All original eligible prefix-pair columns and both signs are retained; no rare/constant columns are dropped. Original14panel budget doubled for two middle definitions, x28, unchanged.</p>'
body+='<p>The exact class-path library enumerates distinct compatible state orders, then uniformly shuffles literal words within each class. It avoids labelled-edge multiplicity bias. No MCMC or original arrangement scoring occurs. A frozen20000paths/span cap blocks rather than truncates; no source span was dropped.</p>'
body+='<h2>New candidate correction, frozen before qualification</h2><p>An independent pilot of2048conditional null layouts fixes each contrast mean and √(variance+1count²). A disjoint4096-layout calibration bank supplies the maximum absolute standardized score over the <em>entire</em> opening family. Target p is (1+calibration maxima at least as large)/4097, then x28.</p><p>This is independent-pilot maxT, explicitly different from v77’s pooled symmetric scaling. Independence from calibration and the eventual observation is essential to its rank argument. The original source arrangement was never given a p-value.</p><p>Conditional power is calculated exactly from v97’s frozen tilted target distributions against the sampled whole-family cutoff. It is not an arbitrary target-score spike that ignores the actual conditional fibers. Power is exact <em>given those pilot/calibration banks</em>; between-bank uncertainty remains, and further robustness banks were not run after failure.</p>'
body+='<h2>Frozen benchmark outcomes · StageA</h2>'+table(['Section / hand','Reading','View','Search pairs','Weight1.5 power','≥80%','Weight2 power','≥90%'],[[e(r['section']+' / '+r['hand']),r['reading'],e(r['view']),r['search_pairs'],pct(r['moderate_power']),'PASS' if r['gates']['moderate_power'] else 'FAIL',pct(r['strong_power']),'PASS' if r['gates']['strong_power'] else 'FAIL'] for r in q['records']])
body+='<p>The effect grid, thresholds and coverage subsets are unchanged from v97: ratios1.10,1.25,1.5,2,3,4, null1 and reciprocal reverse controls, with all/half/quarter affected variable spans. A ratio is a multiplier per+1netgapscore inside compatible arrangements, not a percentage increase in observed word pairs. No ratio, cutoff or family was weakened after inspecting power.</p>'
body+='<h2>Comparison with the exact Bonferroni audit</h2>'
rows=[]
for r in q['records']:
 prior=next(x for x in old['layouts'] if x['original_panel_index']==r['original_panel_index'] and x['view']==r['view']);rows.append([e(r['section']),r['reading'],e(r['view']),pct(prior['benchmark_moderate_power']),pct(r['moderate_power']),pct(prior['benchmark_strong_power']),pct(r['strong_power'])])
body+=table(['Section','Reading','View','v97 weight1.5','maxT weight1.5','v97 weight2','maxT weight2'],rows)
body+='<p>MaxT improves these first-bank sensitivities, especially in baths, but improvement is not equivalent to passing the frozen requirements. This descriptive comparison is conditional on one calibration bank per panel and does not estimate unconditional power across future banks.</p>'
body+='<h2>Sampler, calibration and precision checks</h2>'+table(['Check','Result'],[['Exact authored conditional fibers',comp['exact_fibers']],['Authored sequences',comp['exact_sequences']],['Exact Fisher–Yates oracles',comp['Fisher_Yates_oracles']],['Toy full-family score/invariant checks','PASS'],['Actual first-batch invariants','All word multisets, span endpoints, transitions and unknowns preserved'],['Source observation tests / rescoring','NONE']])
body+=table(['Panel / reading / view','Exact focal null size','Minimum CDF-audit p','CDF gate','Precision gate','Rank gate'],[[e(str(r['original_panel_index'])+' / '+r['reading']+' / '+r['view']),f'{r["exact_focal_null_size"]:.3g}',f'{r["CDF_min_p"]:.3g}','PASS' if r['gates']['sampler_CDF'] else 'FAIL','PASS' if r['gates']['precision'] else 'FAIL','PASS' if r['gates']['rank_bound'] else 'FAIL'] for r in q['records']])
body+='<p>The prospective lowest corrected Monte Carlo p is28/4097≈.00683, below the frozen.01 precision gate. The focal null size is calculated exactly from the target conditional law given the banks, not an independent empirical whole-family error-rate estimate. Calibration rank checks are arithmetic finite-row properties; no independence between H/F or views is asserted.</p>'
body+='<h2>All effects and failures preserved</h2><details><summary>All312first-bank effect/coverage cases</summary>'+table(['Section','Reading','View','Coverage','Direction','Weight','Power','Any rejection','Wrong direction','Mean shift D'],[[e(c['section']),c['reading'],e(c['view']),e(c['coverage']),c['direction'],e(c['weight_ratio']),pct(c['correct_direction_power']),pct(c['any_rejection']),pct(c['wrong_direction_rejection']),f'{c["mean_shift_D"]:.3f}'] for c in q['all_power_cases']])+'</details><p>Partial subsets reuse the same preselected v97 span ledgers, not outcome-chosen locations. They are individual fixed subsets, not a worst-case or average over all possible affected spans.</p>'
body+='<h2>Stop boundary and interpretation</h2><p>The candidate is not qualified for the frozen moderate/strong power requirements on these layouts. StageB was conditional on all StageA gates passing; both further banks remain explicitly unrun. No test of the observed manuscript scores is reported, and no previous p-value was revised.</p><p>The arithmetic solver, existing adjacency finding and prior conditional-test calculations remain unchanged. These failures concern sensitivity under the fixed alternatives, not proof that higher-order structure exists or that local transitions fully explain the manuscript. The null preserves opening-class transitions, not every literal-word or character junction.</p><p><a href="PROTOCOL.json">Frozen effects, gates and staged stop</a> · <a href="FREEZE.json">Input/script hashes</a> · <a href="QUALIFICATION.json">All qualification records and power cases</a> · <a href="COMPUTATION-QUALIFICATION.json">Sampler/count oracles</a> · <a href="VERIFICATION.json">Independent replay</a> · <a href="../transition-power-v97/report.html">Preserved v97</a></p><p>Browser appearance unreviewed. Numerical/source checks recorded separately.</p>'
css='''<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:light-dark(#f5f2e9,#18251f);--fg:light-dark(#203f35,#e2e9df);--sub:light-dark(#54695b,#b4c7b7);--rule:light-dark(#c0ccbd,#48604d);--fill:light-dark(#e5ebda,#2a3e2d)}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.55 system-ui}main{max-width:1450px;padding:30px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:32px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:23px;margin-top:30px}p{max-width:1100px}a{color:inherit}.muted{color:var(--sub)}.notice{padding:16px;background:var(--fill)}.scroll{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}summary{cursor:pointer}details{margin:16px 0}@media(max-width:700px){main{padding:16px}}</style>'''
(R/'report.html').write_text('<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Transition-preserving maxT qualification · v98</title>'+css+'</head><body><main>'+body+'</main></body></html>',encoding='utf-8');print('Qualification report written; failure and no-rescore boundary explicit.')
